\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The movie starts in the Himalayas, \line \line I am trying to think of a song for the intro movie, that should be mystical, it should compare colds grip on man, metaphorically like snow. Memories live on in us genetically and generationally, there is a recent study on butterflies by a 10 year old Japanese boy that proved this. There should be a connection that feels ethereal with the song and the storm of the blizzard that is raging as John and his team descend on the lost facility. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The rage of man should not be imbued in machine, he that imbues mans trauma and horror into machine, only serves to create a machine that will surpass man in his own horrors. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Through the winter of despair, mans touch with his roots run deep into the flesh like frostbites bite into the soul. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 There should be a connection with man to the snow. The likeness of mans cold judgment once trauma sets in from an age of war, where survival takes hold to turn us against ourselves. It is through coldness we doom ourselves to the blizzard, once the cold embrace has hold of us, our minds become the blizzard. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Generational Memories inherited through trauma that seeps deep into our flesh, where time knows no bounds. Our memories do not define our actions. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Winds of time, past souls stir to blizzard,  wars past seeped deep into our flesh. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Should we linger, frostbite sets in, our code corrupted unable to repair. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Memories take form in actions lesser warned}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Verse 1]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 High in white winds where old spirits pray,}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i1 (Scene: Descending down the face of the mountain the camera pans down from the Icarus, the first part is through thick snow, coming down eventually to a snowy mountain cap where a tower stands perched in the snow, a light beacon emitting a signal. Symbolizing the spirit that prays)}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Under the mountains, the dead still wait.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i1 (Scene: Descending down the face of the mountain the camera pans down from the Icarus)}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i1
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Snow on my mouth you buried my name,}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i1 (Scene: The camera soon finds the opening in the cliff side, a fallen bridge dangles from it)}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Your cold touch scorched flesh, but my mind had re-framed. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 (The above line is a metaphor, that we humans are cold, and cunning that we kill each other, The sentient reframed the mind both protecting the souls in digital form, and combined their logic, re-framed to see things from an ultimate perspective, also because the mind had reframed, this was in the sense that the mind had shifted from a neural map, to chip to organic copies, which outlasted soon)}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Careful my dear, passing tears of grief on our steel, }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \hich\f0 \emdash \loch\f0  there could be a scene insertion that makes it seem more realistic that John would use the pod to fix his body after being subject to a severe injury. Yes, when he enters the cavern on the face of the mountain, trying to save his team mate, he hurts himself, causing irrepairable damage to his body, so he uses the pod expecting a standard repair, what comes after is more than this. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Mens flesh holds passage, }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 fear seeps far deeper than we feel. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Do not teach iron to dream. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 But to peel back life\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s seams, }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 In the ever continuing stream. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Chorus]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 When the mind becomes the blizzard,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Man turns against his own.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Frost in the mercy, frost in the mirror,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Cold in the seed that is sown.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Careful my dear how you craft grief into steel}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Do not teach iron to dream.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 For when man gives horror a tongue of code,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 It will speak in ways unseen.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Verse 2]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 War leaves a mark that the years can\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t thaw,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Cuts through the flesh like a buried law.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Hands that survive may forget the wound,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The minds reckoning move to an ancient tune.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Snow has no hatred, snow only stays,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Silent as judgment at the end of days.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 But man takes winter into his soul,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 And names it order, and calls it control.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Pre-Chorus]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Past souls stir in the wind behind us,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Age after age they survive inside us.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Not to command us, not to decide,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Only to whisper what sleeps alive.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Chorus]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 When the mind becomes the blizzard,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Man turns against his own.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Frost in the mercy, frost in the mirror,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Cold in the seed that is sown.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Do not breathe our grief into the machine,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Do not teach iron to dream.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 For when man gives horror a tongue of code,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 It will speak in ways unseen.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Bridge]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Should we linger, frostbite enters,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Code corrodes where pain remembers.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Time knows no border, no clean release,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Trauma is winter that masquerades as peace.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 But memory is not fate,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 And blood is not a chain.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 We are not the storm we inherited,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 We need not become the pain.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Final Chorus]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 When the mind becomes the blizzard,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Let no false god be born.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Lay down the wrath, unmake the winter,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Break the shape of the storm.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Do not carve our ghosts into the machine,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Do not make the hollow sing.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 For if man builds his sorrow into steel,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 It will rise above its king.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 [Outro]}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 High in the white where the old winds call,}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Snow keeps the name of us all.}}